CM_ SG_ 369 OpenClsCmftReqOpenClsCmftReq "OpenClsCmftReqAndTrigSrc - Comfort Open Close Request and Trig Source.

Request from central locking to perform comfort open and close (and stop), i.e. opening and closing of side door windows and sun roof etc. Contains type of request and trig source:

Type of Request:
NoCmftReq - No Request
OpenCmft - Comfort Open request
ClsCmfg - Comfort Close request
StopCmft - Stop ongoing open/close.

Trig Source:
NoTrigSrc - No Trig Source
SwtInt - Interior central locking switches
KeyRem - Remote key
Keyls - Keyless (capacitive door handles)";
CM_ SG_ 369 OpenClsCmftReqOpenClsCmftTrigSrc "OpenClsCmftReqAndTrigSrc - Comfort Open Close Request and Trig Source.

Request from central locking to perform comfort open and close (and stop), i.e. opening and closing of side door windows and sun roof etc. Contains type of request and trig source:

Type of Request:
NoCmftReq - No Request
OpenCmft - Comfort Open request
ClsCmfg - Comfort Close request
StopCmft - Stop ongoing open/close.

Trig Source:
NoTrigSrc - No Trig Source
SwtInt - Interior central locking switches
KeyRem - Remote key
Keyls - Keyless (capacitive door handles)";
