CM_ SG_ 434 TrApprchOpenFbToExtLi "TrApprchOpenFbToExtLi - Trunk Approach Open Feedback to Exterior Light
Request signal from central locking to exterior light, to perform flashing of turn indicators to inform customer that trunk will soon open when approach unlock functionality is active.
0 - 0 Idle (No request)
1 - 1 ExtLigtFBReq (request normal blink)
2 - 2 ExtLigtFBStop (Stop normal blink)
3 - 3 FastExtLigtFBReq (Request Fast blink)
4 - 4 FastExtLigtFBStop (Stop Fast blink)";
