CM_ SG_ 434 TrRelsReqNotSafe "TrRelsReqNotSafe - Tailgate/Bootlid Release Request Not Safe

Request to release the tailgate/bootlid. Signal is filtered through ASIL A SWC to ensure tailgate/bootlid is not relased when vehicle is moving.

On - Release request
Off - No release request";
