This signal is used to activate or deactivate FMDM foor movement detection.
On - Foot movement detection ON
Off - Foot movement detection OFF";
CM_ SG_ 528 WiprActvFromWMM "Information regarding wiper activation";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlLnrAccrPedlRat "CVC filtered accelerator pedal";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlLnrChks "checksum";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlLnrCntr "counter";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlNotCmplPsd "Indicate if the accelerator pedal is not fully pressed. Indicate Yes if it is secured to ASIL-A that the accelerator pedal is not fully pressed. Safe state=No";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlNotCmplPsdChks "Indicate if the accelerator pedal is not fully pressed. Checksum";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlNotCmplPsdCntr "Indicate if the accelerator pedal is not fully pressed. Counter";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlNotCmplPsdSts "Indicate if the accelerator pedal is not fully pressed. If set, then AccrPedlNotCmpl fulfill ASIL-B integrity";
CM_ SG_ 880 AccrPedlRatGrdt "Derivative of accelerator pedal position.";
CM_ SG_ 880 AmbTURaw "Ambient temp raw data in deg C";
CM_ SG_ 880 CrsCtrlrActvnOk "The signal informs if Cruise Controller can be activated or not. Primarily used by HMI to know if Cruise Controller activation requests by driver should be ignored or not.";
CM_ SG_ 880 DeactvtTestCom "Scantool communication on/ff0=on=scantool communication is on1=off=scantool communication is off.";
CM_ SG_ 880 DrvrPrpsnTqReq "Torque request from driver via accelerator pedal.";
CM_ SG_ 880 EngPAmbAir "Ambient pressure";
CM_ SG_ 880 EngPwrCns "The current actual power consumption of power train.";
CM_ SG_ 880 ImobBrkNrSerlReq "ECM request to BCM to send serial number used for immo authentication.";
CM_ SG_ 880 ImobEngSts1 "ECM CEM immo status. Can be undefined, immobilised, motive mobilised or non motive mobilised.";
CM_ SG_ 880 ImobEngSts3 "IGM CEM message immo status. Undefined, immobilised, motive mobilised or non motive mobilised.";
