CM_ SG_ 264 ChdPrtnLeftSwReq "Signal from the Driver door switchpack to the Driver Door module containing the status of the function LED for the left rear Power window disable-child lock switch";
CM_ SG_ 264 ChdPrtnRightSwReq "Signal from the Driver door switchpack to the Driver Door module containing the status of the function LED for the right rear Power window disable or child lock switch";
