CM_ SG_ 431 ErsLockReqByKey "Lock Request, by Engine remote start.
Logic in key gives that Engine Remote Start, can only be requested if lock button is pressed before.
Longer range on the Engine Remote Start message can result in only ERS start message is received (not lock request),
then Lock will be requested from RemInfo, if Engine Remote Start is requested without any Lock request.";
